      "title": "orrery",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## orrery · H3 ref2va (references)\n\nThe CAST names every reference once: `HERO (image 2): …`. Wire each picture into **Orrery Refs** as `image_N`, N as in the CAST; Orrery Refs hands Reference to Video only the images this clip uses, packed as `ref_1`, `ref_2` … in the order the prompt numbers them (`<Picture 1>` …). `preview` shows them labelled. Wire more `ref_N` when a CAST uses more than four images.\n\nThe **Orrery Prompt** node is the whole of orrery: write in its **Prompt** tab (this workflow opens with a quickstart; **New** has the other modes), roll it in **Test** without queueing, and rate what comes out in **Galaxy**: the ratings steer the next rolls. **Generate** in the node queues this graph; what the Save node writes is logged to the galaxy with the picks that made it.\n\n- `seed` drives the rolls and the sampler (Random Noise).\n- `LORA:` lines come out on `lora_stack`, for a loader with a `lora_stack` input (LoraManager, Efficiency …), which is not part of this core-nodes workflow.\n\n[orrery on GitHub](https://github.com/pyros-projects/orrery) · [the prompt language](https://github.com/pyros-projects/orrery/blob/main/docs/dsl.md) · [H3 screenplays](https://github.com/pyros-projects/orrery/blob/main/docs/h3.md)"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## orrery · H3 ref2va (references)\n\nThe CAST names every reference once: `HERO (image 2): …`. Wire each picture into **Orrery Refs** as `image_N`, N as in the CAST; Orrery Refs hands Reference to Video only the images this clip uses, packed as `ref_1`, `ref_2` … in the order the prompt numbers them (`<Picture 1>` …). `preview` shows them labelled. Wire more `ref_N` when a CAST uses more than four images.\n\nThe **Orrery Prompt** node is the whole of orrery: write in its **Prompt** tab (this workflow opens with a quickstart; **New** has the other modes), roll it in **Test** without queueing, and rate what comes out in **Galaxy**: the ratings steer the next rolls. **Generate** in the node queues this graph; what the Save node writes is logged to the galaxy with the picks that made it.\n\n- `seed` drives the rolls and the sampler (Random Noise).\n- `LORA:` lines come out on `lora_stack`, for a loader with a `lora_stack` input (LoraManager, Efficiency …), which is not part of this core-nodes workflow.\n\n[orrery on GitHub](https://github.com/pyros-projects/orrery) · [the prompt language](https://github.com/pyros-projects/orrery/blob/main/docs/dsl.md) · [H3 screenplays](https://github.com/pyros-projects/orrery/blob/main/docs/h3.md)"
